   "design": "Applicants apply online with required fields, attachments and payment, so incomplete forms come back to the applicant instead of the warden chasing them, and no fee is taken at the counter. Fixed rules check the exam, ID and previous permits in the registers and list mismatches for the warden. The permit fills from the application and its issue writes the register entry. Meeting or inspecting, deciding, signing, issuing and questions stay with the warden; every refusal is the warden's decision.",
